    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1084670701023232
    m_Localized: Crochtrain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1084670734577664
    m_Localized: "Green \xB7 crocheted \xB7 button wheels \xB7 pompom"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996235718656
    m_Localized: RAILWAY OPERATIONS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078784
    m_Localized: MY STORY
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078787
    m_Localized: "Skip \xB7 Start"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078788
    m_Localized: "Continue  \u203A"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078789
    m_Localized: 'Space / Enter / A: reveal text or continue     Start: skip introduction'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078790
    m_Localized: A LANDING WITH NO WAY BACK
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078791
    m_Localized: WHAT THEY TOOK FROM ME
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078792
    m_Localized: OUT OF THE RING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078793
    m_Localized: A LIFE ON RAILS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078794
    m_Localized: THE OFFER
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078795
    m_Localized: TRAIN RANKING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078796
    m_Localized: I came to this planet eighty years ago. Eighty! My plan was to get
      fuel, have a little look around and go home, but here I am. Don't give me that
      look; I'd have laughed too if someone had told me I'd be staying this long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078797
    m_Localized: I'm a mecha witch, and where I'm from travelling like that is perfectly
      normal. But these people saw my ship and immediately asked what I'd come to
      conquer. Ooh, scary, a witch looking for fuel! It's not like I arrived shooting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078798
    m_Localized: "So the World Government used that excuse to keep my ship while
      they 'cleared things up'. Whenever I asked about it, they'd send me to another
      counter, then another\u2026 I memorised my case number just so they wouldn't
      get the satisfaction of me losing it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078799
    m_Localized: What worries me most is that my star chart was still aboard. Without
      it I don't know how to get back to the other mecha witches, and after all these
      years I can barely remember the sky back home. That part does scare me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078800
    m_Localized: 'But while they sent me in circles I still had to eat, and I''ve
      always been pretty good at fighting. So when I saw you could get paid to climb
      into a ring here, I thought: well, why didn''t anyone say so? And I got into
      wrestling.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078801
    m_Localized: And I loved it. When the whole crowd was shouting your name, of
      course you wanted to climb the ropes and show off your belt. I did that a lot.
      That's why it hurt when the arenas started closing; I still miss that noise.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078802
    m_Localized: "Then I heard what train drivers earned and went: I want that job!
      They needed people who could defend the cargo, so all I had to do was learn
      to drive. Well, 'all'\u2026 I'm not telling you about my first lessons, or
      you'll want a different driver."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078803
    m_Localized: That's how I ended up with RicMar, and now I wouldn't trade her
      for anything. I can tell something's wrong just by hearing the engine, though
      sometimes I tell her 'don't you start too' before fixing it. I love her, but
      she can't always be right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078804
    m_Localized: 'Then the man in black came, saying they''d seen my work and needed
      someone like me. And I was going: yes, yes, but is this about my ship? Because
      as soon as he''d said ''government'', I''d got so excited I was barely letting
      him speak.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078805
    m_Localized: 'But no, he''d come about the Train Ranking: a competition to take
      a green rock to an alien base and end the attacks. I let him explain then,
      because I wanted to know why he was offering me another delivery instead of
      giving me my stuff back.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078806
    m_Localized: Until he mentioned the prize. Anything I wanted from the World Government!
      I said 'my ship' before he'd finished, then 'and the chart, the chart too!'
      When he said yes, I was already looking for something to sign with.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078807
    m_Localized: "Well, I did ask what the rock did first. I'm not carrying just
      anything because it's green and shiny, even if it is pretty. But then he got
      difficult: military information, don't worry\u2026 How am I supposed not to
      worry if you won't tell me?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078808
    m_Localized: And yes, I accepted anyway. I know, after all that I should've made
      it harder for him, but I could go home. I pictured starting up my ship and
      got carried away. I did get the promise in writing, though; I wasn't having
      any excuses later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078809
    m_Localized: So here I am, with the rock strapped down and RicMar ready to cross
      enemy positions. I'm itching to get going, but I checked the strap again. I
      do like showing off; blowing myself up because I didn't secure the cargo is
      another matter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078810
    m_Localized: Then there are the other drivers, who want to win too. I'm getting
      there first, obviously, but I'm curious what they were promised to make them
      this desperate. I'll try asking before they shoot, because that does get distracting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1128996265078811
    m_Localized: First comes the desert, and I do know those tracks. Come on, RicMar,
      they're getting ahead! You keep up with me and I'll make sure those show-offs
      know who just went past them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
