    m_Localized: 'Keep

      Wagon with {0}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655752
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      A level on the Hero weapon'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655753
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +10% speed'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655754
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      -10% damage taken'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655755
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      Extra max health'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655756
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +20% damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655757
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +15% money'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655758
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +20% fire rate'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655759
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +5 critical chance'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655760
    m_Localized: 'Keep

      +25 critical damage'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655761
    m_Localized: THE TRAIN RANKING
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655762
    m_Localized: THE CITY THAT NEVER SLEEPS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655763
    m_Localized: RAILS AMONG THE STARS
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655764
    m_Localized: THE ALIENS' PLANET
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655765
    m_Localized: THE BASE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655766
    m_Localized: I stuck my tongue out at Onini and pulled my eyelid down so she'd
      get a good look. That's for blocking me! I'd have shown off longer, but I hurt
      everywhere and didn't want her hearing me complain. She'd only say she nearly
      won.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655767
    m_Localized: But just as I was checking the damage, they announced there was
      only one space launch left. One! I packed up however I could and set off for
      the city. I'd won a fight, not finished the job; I wasn't watching someone
      else take my ride.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655768
    m_Localized: Control says there's only enough power to launch one more engine,
      and everyone's racing as if the prize were being handed out already. Wait for
      me, I'm coming too! I don't know if power's really that low, but they're not
      finding out without me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655769
    m_Localized: And now I have to prove I'm human to get in. Now? After years delivering
      their stuff? I'll answer, but if they tell me mecha witches don't count, I
      am making a scene. Let me through first and we can argue afterwards.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655770
    m_Localized: 'I got there first! I wanted to say it on the radio about five times,
      but I had to strap myself in and didn''t have enough hands. When the engines
      fired I went quiet, because after eighty years it was really happening: I was
      going back into space.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655771
    m_Localized: I saw the launcher from the track and checked RicMar's restraints.
      I'd never taken a locomotive into space. Reading the manual before sitting
      on top of it might have helped.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655772
    m_Localized: When I reached the orbital track I couldn't stop looking out the
      window. The stars, that close again! I even wanted to call someone back home
      to show off, and that's when my chest tightened a little. I still didn't know
      how to get back to them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655773
    m_Localized: So I got back to finishing the delivery. I asked control how I'd
      be getting back and they told me to follow directions. I was following them!
      If I had another long trip ahead, I wanted to know before I ran out of fuel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655774
    m_Localized: As soon as Moho stopped following me, I threw my arms up and shouted
      like I'd won another belt. I even took a bow! The celebration didn't last;
      I heard RicMar leaking and we left before it had time to get angry again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655775
    m_Localized: I was already thinking about reaching the delivery planet when I
      remembered RicMar doesn't land like my ship. I needed a track! Good thing I
      started looking before getting any closer; I'd got so excited about arriving
      I'd nearly forgotten the landing part.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655776
    m_Localized: One of those strange plants caught my eye from above, so I leaned
      towards the window for a better look. Then I thought it moved. Oh, no you don't!
      I like new places, but from up there I couldn't even tell what might eat the
      train.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655777
    m_Localized: Luckily I found a track and started lining up the wheels. I did
      have to shut up and concentrate then; showing off to Onini is one thing, landing
      sideways because I'm planning how to brag about it afterwards is another.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655778
    m_Localized: Faceless was so loud! I was thinking, oh please, I could do that
      too when it was my turn to lose in the ring. But I wasn't saying anything;
      if he wanted me gone that badly, fine by me. I even waved from the window like
      I was leaving an arena.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655779
    m_Localized: 'I saved his channel because I already wanted to tell him when I''d
      finished. I was so close! I kept looking towards the fortress and thinking
      about my ship, though I had to stop myself: drop off the rock first, celebrate
      afterwards, not the other way round.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655780
    m_Localized: 'So I reach the fortress all excited and find those enormous gates.
      Did they really need to make them that big? And the turrets were already tracking
      me, so I ducked, then got annoyed: it looked as if they were making me hide.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655781
    m_Localized: I wanted to break through already, but first I asked control how
      they planned to get me out afterwards. I might be desperate to finish, but
      they weren't taking RicMar from me too. I'd keep asking until they gave me
      an exit, even if they got sick of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655782
    m_Localized: I got out before the explosion reached RicMar, but however much
      I called control, nobody answered. I followed the beacons back and found the
      government base destroyed when I reached Earth. Other drivers were searching
      the wreckage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655783
    m_Localized: That's where they started telling me about clones and the samples
      they'd taken from the racers. At first I couldn't see what that had to do with
      our delivery; I kept asking about my ship, thinking someone would know where
      they'd kept it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2507960170655784
    m_Localized: But when they told me the Pulxsar had come to trade silicon, I couldn't
      keep thinking only about getting home. I'd just delivered that rock to their
      base without even knowing what it did, and now there was nobody I could ask
      how many people were inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276164661248
    m_Localized: Chapters
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215680
    m_Localized: '[{0}] continue'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215681
    m_Localized: Onini, move over a little! I'm trying to overtake, not find out
      what your boiler tastes like.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215682
    m_Localized: Then don't breathe so hard. Winning this delivery gets me out of
      hell, so you're going to have to wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215683
    m_Localized: "Well, I get my ship back! Let's see who's got more\u2026 Wait,
      that voice. Didn't you fight in the arenas?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215684
    m_Localized: It was the boiler! If I hadn't lost pressure, I'd be watching you
      in my mirror right now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215685
    m_Localized: Ha! I knew it! But do check it, all right? Next time I want to show
      off, not find you've already fallen apart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215686
    m_Localized: 'Attention, racers: we''ve only got power for one more launch. The
      first locomotive inside gets to go up.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215687
    m_Localized: Hear that, Cerebron? First one there! You can start practising how
      you're going to congratulate me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215688
    m_Localized: I'd rather you and that rock moved aside. Did they at least tell
      you what you're carrying?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215689
    m_Localized: The orbital route follows the beacons. Try not to mistake a signal
      for something you can punch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215690
    m_Localized: Thanks for the directions. I usually ask before punching public
      infrastructure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215691
    m_Localized: Another locomotive? And who are you? Nobody's given you permission
      to come through here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215692
    m_Localized: I'm BBA! I'm just following those beacons, don't get like that.
      If you need me to ask permission, I will, but make it quick, all right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215693
    m_Localized: You're already asking, and I'm already telling you no. Turn around!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215694
    m_Localized: Ha, now you're letting me through! Come on, RicMar, before it finds
      another eye we haven't seen yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215695
    m_Localized: I'm following the beacons before anything else arrives.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215696
    m_Localized: Stop a moment. I'm Faceless, this planet's champion, and I've been
      sent to stop you going any further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215697
    m_Localized: But I'm nearly there! Can't you call whoever sent you and tell them
      I'm just dropping something off? I won't hold you up, honestly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215698
    m_Localized: I could call him, but he'd just tell me to stop you again. I've
      been hearing it for quite a while, believe me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215699
    m_Localized: Oh, noooo! You've defeated me! Now I can't follow you! Is everyone
      hearing this on the radio?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215700
    m_Localized: Yes, yes, I heard it all the way over here! Stop saying it so loudly,
      you'll make me feel important. Take care of T.exe; I'm going before you change
      your mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215701
    m_Localized: BBA, you'll have to leave the wagons here. The service corridor
      is too narrow for the whole train.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215702
    m_Localized: All right, but tell me where to leave it and how to get out. Both
      things! Don't cut the radio the moment I deliver the package.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215703
    m_Localized: There's a ventilation hatch at the far end; you need to throw the
      rock through it. Then follow the beacons we're sending you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215704
    m_Localized: The rock is inside. I'm heading for the exit. Control, do you read
      me?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2510276198215705
    m_Localized: Still no answer. I'm staying on the beacon route.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637377671168
    m_Localized: Bombs! Shoot them down before they land
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637411225600
    m_Localized: Boarders! Robots are jumping at your train
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2524637411225601
    m_Localized: Engine overheated! Double damage
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
